 copnet path e.g. /obj/Cop_PeelPlates_01\\n  node?: string;\\n  // proof resolution, defaults to 1024\\n  res?: number;\\n  // version tag e.g. v001 or latest for restore\\n  version?: string;\\n}): Promise<CallToolResult>; };\\n```\"},{\"name\":\"mcp__zenray_houdini__houdini_hom\",\"description\":\"Escape hatch: run HOM code. target=live talks to the open session, target=headless runs hython. Put the value to return in `result`.\\n\\nexec tool declaration:\\n```ts\\ndeclare const tools: { mcp__zenray_houdini__houdini_hom(args: { code: string; target?: \\\"live\\\" | \\\"headless\\\"; }): Promise<CallToolResult>; };\\n```\"},{\"name\":\"mcp__zenray_houdini__houdini_recipes\",\"description\":\"List the Houdini graphs already built AND verified, with their parameters.\\n\\nexec tool declaration:\\n```ts\\ndeclare const tools: { mcp__zenray_houdini__houdini_recipes(args: { [key: string]: unknown; }): Promise<CallToolResult>; };\\n```\"},{\"name\":\"mcp__zenray_houdini__houdini_scene\",\"description\":\"Return the OPEN Houdini scene as compact JSON: paths, types, errors, point and primitive counts. Requires zrbridge.py running inside Houdini.\\n\\nexec tool declaration:\\n```ts\\ndeclare const tools: { mcp__zenray_houdini__houdini_scene(args: {\\n  // defaults to 2\\n  depth?: number;\\n  // defaults to /obj\\n  path?: string;\\n}): Promise<CallToolResult>; };\\n```\"},{\"name\":\"mcp__zenray_houdini__houdini_search\",\"description\":\"Search a node or a VEX function in the complete Houdini 22 vocabulary (5564 nodes, 1132 functions). Houdini does not need to be open.\\n\\nexec tool declaration:\\n```ts\\ndeclare const tools: { mcp__zenray_houdini__houdini_search(args: {\\n  // scattering, instancing, uv, materials, textures, simulation, destruction, terrain, curves, crowd, rendering, export, vex, attributes, modeling\\n  family?: string;\\n  // defaults to nodes\\n  kind?: \\\"nodes\\\" | \\\"vex\\\";\\n  limit?: number;\\n  // term searched in the name or the summary\\