{"timestamp":"2026-09-19T19:53:30.818Z","ordinal":2359,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a0ba36-4593-7112-93f8-623903f3846f","turn_id":"01a0bb38-4044-72b0-abcb-0182caa97bb9","item":{"type":"CommandExecution","id":"exec-eabd80b8-4c65-4cc4-99d9-17b5176b0660","process_id":"23583","command":["/bin/zsh","-lc","sed -n '1,220p' /Users/zenray/.claude/tmp/tmp-adrianpan-macos-contribution/UPSTREAM_PROPOSAL.md"],"cwd":"file:///Users/zenray/.claude/Memory1","parsed_cmd":[{"type":"read","cmd":"sed -n '1,220p' /Users/zenray/.claude/tmp/tmp-adrianpan-macos-contribution/UPSTREAM_PROPOSAL.md","name":"UPSTREAM_PROPOSAL.md","path":"/Users/zenray/.claude/tmp/tmp-adrianpan-macos-contribution/UPSTREAM_PROPOSAL.md"}],"source":"unified_exec_startup","status":"completed","stdout":"# macOS arm64 precompiled artifact for UE 5.8\n\n## Proposed contribution\n\nI built the `29ed653` source of HoudiniEngineForUnreal on macOS arm64 with Unreal Engine 5.8 and Houdini 22.0.368.\n\nThe build produces these editor modules:\n\n- `libUnrealEditor-HoudiniEngine.dylib`\n- `libUnrealEditor-HoudiniEngineEditor.dylib`\n\nBoth binaries are Mach-O arm64 libraries and load successfully in an isolated Unreal Engine 5.8 project. The editor log confirms that the plugin loads Houdini 22.0.368 from the configured Houdini Resources directory.\n\n## Source changes required by this build\n\n1. Add the missing `fcntl.h` and `unistd.h` declarations for the macOS and Linux shared-memory implementation.\n2. Add UE 5.8 UHT categories to the exposed Houdini asset, node, and settings properties.\n3. Disable the UE 5.8 Clang unreachable-code warning for the two legacy plugin modules. This warning is treated as an error by the current Apple toolchain although the affected code is valid for the plugin's supported configurations.\n\nThe complete source diff is included in `AdrianPan-MacOS-UE58.patch`.\n\n## Reproduction\n\n```text\nUnreal Engine: 5.8\nHoudini: 22.0.368\nHost: macOS arm64\nCompiler: Apple Clang 21.0.0\nMac SDK: 27.0\nResult: 64 actions, Succeeded\n```\n\nThe archive is intended for the `Plugins/HoudiniEngine` directory of a UE 5.8 project. It is a macOS arm64 artifact and does not replace the existing Windows release assets.\n\n## Suggested release asset\n\n`HoudiniEngineForUnreal5_8_Houdini22_0_v2026_09_19_MacOS_arm64.zip`\n\nThe SHA-256 checksum is in `SHA256SUMS.txt`.\n","stderr":"","aggregated_output":"# macOS arm64 precompiled artifact for UE 5.8\n\n## Proposed contribution\n\nI built the `29ed653` source of HoudiniEngineForUnreal on macOS arm64 with Unreal Engine 5.8 and Houdini 22.0.368.\n\nThe build produces these editor modules:\n\n- `libUnrealEditor-HoudiniEngine.dylib`\n- `libUnrealEditor-HoudiniEngineEditor.dylib`\n\nBoth binaries are Mach-O arm64 libraries and load successfully in an isolated Unreal Engine 5.8 project. The editor log confirms that the plugin loads Houdini 22.0.368 from the configured Houdini Resources directory.\n\n## Source changes required by this build\n\n1. Add the missing `fcntl.h` and `unistd.h` declarations for the macOS and Linux shared-memory implementation.\n2. Add UE 5.8 UHT categories to the exposed Houdini asset, node, and settings properties.\n3. Disable the UE 5.8 Clang unreachable-code warning for the two legacy plugin modules. This warning is treated as an error by the current Apple toolchain although the affected code is valid for the plugin's supported configurations.\n\nThe complete source diff is included in `AdrianPan-MacOS-UE58.patch`.\n\n## Reproduction\n\n```text\nUnreal Engine: 5.8\nHoudini: 22.0.368\nHost: macOS arm64\nCompiler: Apple Clang 21.0.0\nMac SDK: 27.0\nResult: 64 actions, Succeeded\n```\n\nThe archive is intended for the `Plugins/HoudiniEngine` directory of a UE 5.8 project. It is a macOS arm64 artifact and does not replace the existing Windows release assets.\n\n## Suggested release asset\n\n`HoudiniEngineForUnreal5_8_Houdini22_0_v2026_09_19_MacOS_arm64.zip`\n\nThe SHA-256 checksum is in `SHA256SUMS.txt`.\n","exit_code":0,"duration":{"secs":0,"nanos":7625},"formatted_output":"# macOS arm64 precompiled artifact for UE 5.8\n\n## Proposed contribution\n\nI built the `29ed653` source of HoudiniEngineForUnreal on macOS arm64 with Unreal Engine 5.8 and Houdini 22.0.368.\n\nThe build produces these editor modules:\n\n- `libUnrealEditor-HoudiniEngine.dylib`\n- `libUnrealEditor-HoudiniEngineEditor.dylib`\n\nBoth binaries are Mach-O arm64 libraries and load successfully in an isolated Unreal Engine 5.8 project. The editor log confirms that the plugin loads Houdini 22.0.368 from the configured Houdini Resources directory.\n\n## Source changes required by this build\n\n1. Add the missing `fcntl.h` and `unistd.h` declarations for the macOS and Linux shared-memory implementation.\n2. Add UE 5.8 UHT categories to the exposed Houdini asset, node, and settings properties.\n3. Disable the UE 5.8 Clang unreachable-code warning for the two legacy plugin modules. This warning is treated as an error by the current Apple toolchain although the affected code is valid for the plugin's supported configurations.\n\nThe complete source diff is included in `AdrianPan-MacOS-UE58.patch`.\n\n## Reproduction\n\n```text\nUnreal Engine: 5.8\nHoudini: 22.0.368\nHost: macOS arm64\nCompiler: Apple Clang 21.0.0\nMac SDK: 27.0\nResult: 64 actions, Succeeded\n```\n\nThe archive is intended for the `Plugins/HoudiniEngine` directory of a UE 5.8 project. It is a macOS arm64 artifact and does not replace the existing Windows release assets.\n\n## Suggested release asset\n\n`HoudiniEngineForUnreal5_8_Houdini22_0_v2026_09_19_MacOS_arm64.zip`\n\nThe SHA-256 checksum is in `SHA256SUMS.txt`.\n"},"started_at_ms":1789847610817,"completed_at_ms":1789847610818}}
